      "id": "ca746088e64c6372104c",
      "target": {
        "text": "There'll be plenty of time for gray area weapons testing later.",
        "source": "generated",
        "model": "gpt-transcribe"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "54282126c8521d4e1a20",
      "target": {
        "text": "If they wanna put us down, they're gonna have to work for it.",
        "source": "official"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "f3d66bc1efc17efd4ccd",
      "target": {
        "text": "Time for some heavy ordinance.",
        "source": "official"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "f979f5b78dd39d938a6c",
      "target": {
        "text": "Time to block 'em off…",
        "source": "official"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "64efdacd3ebedc474904",
      "target": {
        "text": "Cutting 'em off!",
        "source": "official"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "fc9a7426f05819503355",
      "target": {
        "text": "I'll flank 'em",
        "source": "official"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "978af4e41999446d6f04",
      "target": {
        "text": "Just want to get ahead of this: I will probably misuse the wall at somepoint, and I'm sorry in advace",
        "source": "official"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "abde3df61a97c0dd4cd7",
      "target": {
        "text": "Say the word and I'm going to blow stuff up",
        "source": "official"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "b84b839908813d6bbb58",
      "target": {
        "text": "Abrams is leading the charge!",
        "source": "generated",
        "model": "gpt-4o-mini-transcribe"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a03d04dd621924dc79e7",
      "target": {
        "text": "Your precision is impecable Haze",
        "source": "official"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "d8e3588933cfa2f712b7",
      "target": {
        "text": "If we don't come together, we're doomed.",
        "source": "generated",
        "model": "gpt-4o-mini-transcribe"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "7c7014e4b465ba1e9468",
      "target": {
        "text": "You're a monster Seven, and you got what you desered…",
        "source": "official"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "33847b637c5764aea932",
      "target": {
        "text": "I could use someone with your intelect McGinnis…",
        "source": "official"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "294f8ee71cc55226bbde",
      "target": {
        "text": "McGinnis, we've had ammicable dealings before… why throw your life away now?",
        "source": "official"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "5080d9345c134ade4f63",
      "target": {
        "text": "I'm through with you",
        "source": "official"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "bcbe10f643f64973bba2",
      "target": {
        "text": "There's nothing I can't aquire..",
        "source": "official"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "26a0340156e103c02c41",
      "target": {
        "text": "The lives of the weak are meant to sustain the lives of the strong.",
        "source": "official"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "b0516bdff9943f2eb813",
      "target": {
        "text": "Ready to steal their vitatlity….",
        "source": "official"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "4f688df5df9707b70471",
      "target": {
        "text": "I'm unstoppable!",
        "source": "official"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "5c9395c458bacc4257b7",
      "target": {
        "text": "Holliday's on top of the garage!",
        "source": "official"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "4e9bdb2cb80b5327ec52",
      "target": {
        "text": "Holliday's on top of the garage!",
        "source": "official"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "94d6fd47ebb8f203de93",
      "target": {
        "text": "I'll flank 'em",
        "source": "official"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "57b94e63ee4551518139",
      "target": {
        "text": "Your pursuit of vanity is as pathetic as it is cliché",
        "source": "official"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "385ee3006eed3afed514",
      "target": {
        "text": "I took 'em out.",
        "source": "official"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "1863219e0645708249e3",
      "target": {
        "text": "Let's see 'em try to get close to me.",
        "source": "official"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "274d1c1e31d07284348c",
      "target": {
        "text": "I'm gonna tear through their defenses.",
        "source": "official"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "f3e550287c816781a72b",
      "target": {
        "text": "They're not even gonna hear the bullet that kills them…",
        "source": "official"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "d658cfa7f0c359a9d5e5",
      "target": {
        "text": "I'll get the drop on 'em.",
        "source": "official"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "4df9fd69d09e77796c84",
      "target": {
        "text": "Holliday's under the garage!",
        "source": "official"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "f86610d34d0ac3f29ed7",
      "target": {
        "text": "Holliday's under the garage!",
        "source": "official"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "02a722af427900c5bb23",
      "target": {
        "text": "I could never trade my morals for coin like that woman…",
        "source": "official"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "558477937f9a47c1eca3",
      "target": {
        "text": "We're not cat people.",
        "source": "official"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "e139360d35a628f924ee",
      "target": {
        "text": "We're not afraid of you Seven…",
        "source": "official"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ae4b6f6f1dd0ff2c6321",
      "target": {
        "text": "The ghost lady is dead. Well, she was already dead I suppose, but now she's even more dead.",
        "source": "official"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "4594ab9f69e2507cd28c",
      "target": {
        "text": "Hm. I thought they'd put up a fight, I guess I can be wrong",
        "source": "official"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ad718e14d7cef2a3222b",
      "target": {
        "text": "I'm surrounded by incompetence.",
        "source": "generated",
        "model": "gpt-4o-mini-transcribe"
      }
    },
    {
