        "source": "official"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "e7b1a0730ac53a85b89f",
      "target": {
        "text": "They need to stay out of my way if they don't want to be hurt…",
        "source": "official"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "d0148525dfec9ce6d3a0",
      "target": {
        "text": "They need to stay out of my way if they don't want to be hurt…",
        "source": "official"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "8e4e74e3385c8e97efaa",
      "target": {
        "text": "My father's gift for my 18th birthday was a bullet to the chest. Today's my chance to say thank you.",
        "source": "generated",
        "model": "gpt-4o-mini-transcribe"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "005fd8eab75c9eddb47a",
